>  -- He obviously wields weapons (since he hits things fast and
>     furious with his silver saber).  I got a highly enchanted
>     Excalibur in a bones file, so once I got it uncursed, I
>     switched to it, but my pet doesn't seem to want to use
>     Snickersee.  How can I get him to use it?  (Or does the fact
>     that he's chaotic mean that he won't pick it up?)

That's the issue.  Monsters will pick up artifacts of their own
alignment or unaligned ones.  If you're lawful you won't get
chaotic artifacts as gifts.  Orcrist, Sting and so on.  Pets will
wield any artifact they pick up, even if they are already
wielding some other artifact.  That's how you get your pet
to give Frost Brand back to you.

There is a certain comic value to giving your pet troll Orgesmasher
and your pet ogre Trollsbane.



